czmq3
------------------------------------------
CZMQ - High-level C Binding for ZeroMQ. This is the 3.x API, which czmq 4.x no
longer provides (zctx, zauth, zsocket, ...). It installs beside czmq: headers
in /usr/include/czmq3, libczmq3.pc and libczmq3.dll.a.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libczmq3-3.0.2-1bl1
  libczmq3-devel-3.0.2-1bl1
  libzmq5-4.3.5-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libzmq-devel-4.3.5-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://czmq.zeromq.org/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/zeromq/czmq/archive/v3.0.2.tar.gz#/czmq-3.0.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack czmq3-3.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./czmq3-3.0.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/czmq3-3.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/czmq3-3.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libczmq3-3.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libczmq3-devel-3.0.2-X.tar.xz

